    "summaries": [
      {
        "action_date": "2025-01-15",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Nuclear Waste Informed Consent Act</strong></p><p>This bill prohibits the Department of Energy (DOE) from using the Nuclear Waste Fund for certain activities related to radioactive waste disposal unless DOE has entered into a written agreement for a repository with (1) the governor of the&nbsp;state in which the proposed repository will be located, (2) affected local governments, (3) local&nbsp;governments contiguous to the affected local governments if spent nuclear fuel or high-level radioactive waste will be transported through them for disposal at the repository, and (4) affected Indian tribes.</p>",
        "update_date": "2025-04-15T12:52:10Z"
      }
    ]
  },
